launch.json
.venv/
__pycache__
voxcpm.egg-info
.DS_Store
./pretrained_models/
app_local.py

# Generated voice-preview cache (regenerate with scripts/pregenerate_previews.py)
assets/voice_previews/
# Recordings a cloned voice is built from. Never committed: this repository is
# public, and a voice sample is the one asset that lets anyone impersonate its
# owner. The preset entry that points at one is committed; the audio is not.
assets/voices/

# Archived generations
output/

# La file de production : textes narrables des manuscrits, couvertures, état
# d'avancement, extraits d'écoute. Rien de tout cela n'a sa place dans un dépôt
# public — ce sont les livres eux-mêmes, pas le moteur qui les lit. La file se
# reconstruit depuis le catalogue avec scripts/construire_file.py.
queue/
temoin/
